          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Leza wakacita mulengalenga oyo, waanzaanya maanzi aali ansi lyamulengalenga amaanzi aali kujulu lyamulengalenga. Mbuboobo mbukwakaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino oyo mulengalenga Leza wakauulika kuti ndijulu. Aboobo kwakaba igoko alimwi kwakaba cifumo, buzuba bwabili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.8",
